// CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID (1), RT_MANIFEST (24).
// Declares PerMonitorV2 DPI awareness and asInvoker execution level so
// Windows applies them before any window is created.
1 24 "app.manifest"

// The executable's icon — Explorer, Alt+Tab, and installers all pick up
// whichever icon has the lowest resource ID, so this being the only ICON
// resource is what makes it the one used. Regenerate with
// generate-icons.ps1 from development/logo.png.
1 ICON "app.ico"
